1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,440
How does a bank install this system on its own servers, with no setting left at a default and no secret typed into a file?

2
00:00:07,490 --> 00:00:16,560
The system ships as two units, installed separately: the cards unit first, because it is the card zone, then ecom, which only calls it.

3
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:27,168
Each unit is one Docker Compose install with its own Vault, Postgres, Keycloak and monitoring; the Kubernetes manifests are parked, and Compose is the reference install.

4
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:35,232
Every setting lives in Vault: each service's settings are rendered into environment variables, and the services read only those.

5
00:00:35,282 --> 00:00:39,696
Nothing has a default: a missing value stops startup, and the error names it.

6
00:00:39,746 --> 00:00:48,240
Opening Vault stays human: it starts with five unseal shares, any three of them open it, and each share is held by a different person.

7
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:54,720
The root token is used only for setup and then revoked; any later change needs three keyholders again.

8
00:00:54,770 --> 00:01:07,536
Everything else is code: OpenTofu creates Vault's setup and every service's settings, and generates every password, key and certificate, with its own state encrypted by a passphrase.

9
00:01:07,586 --> 00:01:19,296
One procedure runs on a laptop, a dev server and production; only what the environment alone knows is typed in, once, and OpenTofu names any value that is missing or malformed.

10
00:01:19,346 --> 00:01:27,984
The first bank admins come from one input, at least two of them, so nobody holds the bank side alone; each sets their own password and authenticator app.

11
00:01:28,034 --> 00:01:37,080
A release is a tag: its images are pinned to that version, built for x86 and ARM, each with a bill of materials and build provenance.

12
00:01:37,130 --> 00:01:44,904
There is no deploy repository of ours: which version runs where is the bank's state, in its own Git, under its own change control.

13
00:01:44,954 --> 00:01:52,488
The card zone is the bank's vault room, with walls, guards, cameras and patching; the product is the safe delivered into it.

14
00:01:52,538 --> 00:02:03,792
So each unit ships an implementation guide: what the zone must provide, how to install and run the product, and a P C I D S S matrix of what the product does and what the bank does.

15
00:02:03,842 --> 00:02:07,920
Next: the cards unit, its two doors and its certificates.
